id: grappler
name: Grappler
order: 3
optionOf: refined-combat
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  If you successfully initiate a Grapple with a Studied Opponent, you may use the Launch Maneuver or Pin Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, that Opponent stops being Studied after you complete that Maneuver.
text: >
  Grappler [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you successfully initiate a Grapple with a Studied Opponent, you may use the Launch Maneuver or Pin Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, that Opponent stops being Studied after you complete that Maneuver.

---

# A Grapple begun with one you Studied: the Launch and the Pin offered on its card out of sequence, once a Round - the Study
# ended as one is taken (chat.mjs settleGrapple).
[passive]
allow refined.grappler;
